    <p>(c) The rules and regulations shall be published for distribution as soon as practicable after adoption.</p>
    <p>(d) This section shall be liberally construed in order that the purposes of the Donahue Higher Education Act pursuant to Part 40 (commencing with Section 66010) of Division 5 may be effected.</p>
    <p>89031. The trustees may establish rules and regulations for the government and maintenance of the buildings and grounds of the University. Any person who violates or attempts to violate the rules and regulations is guilty of a misdemeanor.</p>
